0010EFr 2               ; do_for — FOR [var start end] [body]
0010EFr 2               ;   Arity 0 — handles its own argument parsing
0010EFr 2               ;   1. Parse control list [varname start end]
0010EFr 2               ;   2. Parse body [...]
